 ploads/event/Screenshot%202026-04-24%20at%203.34.45%E2%80%AFPM_20260424213
 526970990.png
DESCRIPTION:The June 2rd California primary is just weeks away and we have
  the opportunity to help California's 22nd congressional district have a t
 rue progressive on the ballot in November. Join on on Thursday evenings to
  call voters in CA-22 to build support and get out the vote for Randy Vill
 egas for Congress! All welcome. No experience needed. Our hosts are ready 
 to train and support you whether this is your first call or your thousandt
 h.
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisibleyolo/event/945313/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Yolo (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
