 ploads/event/postcard-party%20%281%29_20260212003524527686.png
DESCRIPTION:## Sign up\, roll in\, and sit down to write postcards with ol
 d and new friends! We are writing for candidates and causes in critical sw
 ing districts...laying the ground for a win this November! - **West Davis*
